>Perhaps It's different for alpha?

Not sure what is considered "acceptable" temp. on an Alpha, but there is no 
way on a Miata box to monitor it.  There's simply no sensors built into the 
system.

The only systems that I'm aware of are UP1000,UP2000/+,& CS20, but you need 
to use a special app called hwmon (available from 
http://alo.alphadriven.org/firmware/api/CS20/hwmon-1.0.3.tar.gz)

cheers,
rob

